{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H11100","actionDate":"2025-07-23","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Energy and Commerce.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"Intro-H","actionDate":"2025-07-23","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"1000","actionDate":"2025-07-23","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"}],"congress":119,"congressGovUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/4745","cosponsors":[{"bioguideId":"F000466","fullName":"Rep. Fitzpatrick, Brian K. [R-PA-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-07-23","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"},{"bioguideId":"T000488","fullName":"Rep. Thanedar, Shri [D-MI-13]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-10-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MI"},{"bioguideId":"S001218","fullName":"Rep. Stansbury, Melanie A. [D-NM-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-05-11","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NM"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T22:18:57+00:00","id":"hr4745-119","introducedDate":"2025-07-23","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-07-23","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Energy and Commerce."},"laws":[],"number":"4745","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Health","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"T000469","district":20,"fullName":"Rep. Tonko, Paul [D-NY-20]","party":"D","state":"NY"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-07-23","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><b>Medicaid Bump Act</b></p> <p>This bill increases the Medicaid federal matching rate, also known as the Federal Medical Assistance Percentage (FMAP), for behavioral health expenses that exceed prior levels (i.e., as of March 31, 2019). The Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services must specify which services are eligible for the increased FMAP. States must use funds to supplement state funding for pro